#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.rst:2
msgid "nanmedian"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:1
msgid "Compute the median of a tensor, ignoring NaN values."
msgstr "NaN 値を無視して、テンソルの中央値を計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:3
msgid ""
"This function calculates the median of tensor elements along the "
"specified dimension(s) while excluding NaN values from the computation.  "
"It extends ``torch.nanmedian`` with support for reducing over multiple "
"dimensions at once, matching the unified :attr:`dim` semantics of the "
"other NaN-aware reductions in this package (e.g., :func:`nanmean`), and "
"it always returns median values only (never indices).  If all values of a"
" reduced slice are NaN, the result for that slice is NaN."
msgstr "この関数は、指定された次元に沿ってテンソル要素の中央値を計算します。計算時には NaN 値は除外されます。この関数は ``torch.nanmedian`` を拡張して複数の次元を一度に縮約できるようにしたもので、このパッケージの他の NaN を考慮した縮約関数（例: :func:`nanmean`）と統一された :attr:`dim` のセマンティクスに従います。また、常に中央値のみを返し、インデックスを返すことはありません。縮約対象のスライスのすべての値が NaN の場合、そのスライスの結果は NaN になります。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:13
msgid "The input tensor containing values."
msgstr "値を含む入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:16
msgid ""
"The dimension(s) along which to compute the median.  If None (default), "
"the median is computed over all elements."
msgstr "中央値を計算する次元を指定します。None（デフォルト）の場合は、すべての要素に対して中央値が計算されます。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:20
msgid ""
"Whether the output tensor has :attr:`dim` retained or not. Default is "
"False."
msgstr "出力テンソルが :attr:`dim` を保持するかどうか。デフォルトは False。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:24
msgid ""
"The median values computed only over valid (non-NaN) values.  The shape "
"depends on the input dimensions, :attr:`dim`, and :attr:`keepdim` "
"parameters."
msgstr "有効な値（NaN でない値）のみに基づいて計算された中央値。形状は入力次元、:attr:`dim` パラメータ、および :attr:`keepdim` パラメータに依存します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:30
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:32
msgid ""
">>> # For an even number of valid values, the lower of the two\n"
">>> # middle values (2.0, not 3.0) is returned.\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([2.0, 1.0, nan, 5.0, 4.0])\n"
">>> QF.nanmedian(x)\n"
"tensor(2.)"
msgstr ""
">>> # 有効な値の個数が偶数の場合、2 つの中央の値のうち\n"
">>> # 小さい方（3.0 ではなく 2.0）が返されます。\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([2.0, 1.0, nan, 5.0, 4.0])\n"
">>> QF.nanmedian(x)\n"
"tensor(2.)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:38
msgid ""
">>> # nanquantile averages the two middle values instead.\n"
">>> QF.nanquantile(x, 0.5)\n"
"tensor(3.)"
msgstr ""
">>> # nanquantile は代わりに 2 つの中央の値を平均します。\n"
">>> QF.nanquantile(x, 0.5)\n"
"tensor(3.)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:42
msgid ""
">>> # 2D tensor with dimension specification\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0, nan],\n"
"...                   [4.0, nan, 6.0]])\n"
">>> QF.nanmedian(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([1., 4.])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 次元を指定した 2 次元テンソル\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0, nan],\n"
"...                   [4.0, nan, 6.0]])\n"
">>> QF.nanmedian(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([1., 4.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:48
msgid ""
">>> # Keep dimensions\n"
">>> QF.nanmedian(x, dim=1, keepdim=True)\n"
"tensor([[1.],\n"
"        [4.]])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 次元を保持\n"
">>> QF.nanmedian(x, dim=1, keepdim=True)\n"
"tensor([[1.],\n"
"        [4.]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:53
msgid ""
">>> # Multiple dimensions\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[[1.0, 2.0], [3.0, nan]],\n"
"...                   [[5.0, 6.0], [7.0, 8.0]]])\n"
">>> QF.nanmedian(x, dim=(1, 2))\n"
"tensor([2., 6.])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 複数の次元\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[[1.0, 2.0], [3.0, nan]],\n"
"...                   [[5.0, 6.0], [7.0, 8.0]]])\n"
">>> QF.nanmedian(x, dim=(1, 2))\n"
"tensor([2., 6.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:59
msgid ""
">>> # All-NaN slice yields NaN\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0],\n"
"...                   [nan, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.nanmedian(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([1., nan])"
msgstr ""
">>> # すべて NaN のスライスは NaN になる\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0],\n"
"...                   [nan, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.nanmedian(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([1., nan])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:65
msgid ""
"Like ``torch.nanmedian`` (and unlike ``numpy.nanmedian``), when a slice "
"has an even number of valid values, this function returns the lower of "
"the two middle values instead of their average.  As a consequence, the "
"result is always one of the input values.  For the interpolated "
"(averaging) behavior, use ``QF.nanquantile(x, 0.5)``."
msgstr "``torch.nanmedian`` と同様に（``numpy.nanmedian`` とは異なり）、スライス内の有効な値の個数が偶数の場合、この関数はそれらの平均ではなく、2 つの中央の値のうち小さい方を返します。その結果、戻り値は常に入力値のいずれかになります。補間（平均）する動作が必要な場合は、``QF.nanquantile(x, 0.5)`` を使用してください。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:73
msgid ""
":func:`nanquantile`: NaN-aware quantile function (``q=0.5`` averages the "
"two middle values)."
msgstr ":func:`nanquantile`: NaN を考慮した分位点関数（``q=0.5`` は 2 つの中央の値を平均します）。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:75
msgid ":func:`mmedian`: Moving (sliding window) median function."
msgstr ":func:`mmedian`: 移動（スライディングウィンドウ）中央値関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanmedian.nanmedian:76
msgid ""
"``torch.nanmedian``: PyTorch's built-in NaN-aware median (single-"
"dimension reduction only)."
msgstr "``torch.nanmedian``: PyTorch に組み込まれた NaN を考慮した中央値関数（単一次元の縮約のみ対応）。"

